WEBVTT

01:31.880 --> 01:33.720
BROCADE BUREAU

01:33.800 --> 01:34.640
What is the update
on the foreign merchants?

01:35.360 --> 01:38.400
We looked into the foreign merchants
transporting brocade to Nanzhao.

01:38.480 --> 01:40.160
The records, finances,
and personnel were all checked out.

01:44.000 --> 01:44.960
Are you feeling better now?

01:50.680 --> 01:51.840
What do you think?

01:52.680 --> 01:54.920
Looking at you now,
you are ready to crash another wedding.

01:55.000 --> 01:57.120
Forget it. One is enough for me.

01:57.200 --> 01:58.080
What is this?

01:58.720 --> 01:59.680
Oh, right.

02:00.560 --> 02:01.800
The group that went
to Nanzhao has returned.

02:01.880 --> 02:03.920
Turns out Bai Sheng is Prince Bai.

02:10.720 --> 02:11.920
Bai Sheng.

02:12.960 --> 02:14.000
Prince Bai.

02:14.520 --> 02:16.240
Here is the evidence.

02:19.520 --> 02:20.480
Shu Red Brocade?

02:22.760 --> 02:25.400
Draft another document
to explain things clearly.

02:25.480 --> 02:26.720
We should ask
the Crown Prince to intervene.

02:28.400 --> 02:29.600
The intervention needs to happen fast.

02:30.600 --> 02:32.280
Write this.

02:33.280 --> 02:35.640
If there is any delay,
your junior's life will be at stake.

02:39.520 --> 02:42.160
That said, although we have the evidence,

02:42.840 --> 02:44.600
he is still the prince of Nanzhao.

02:44.680 --> 02:48.120
The court would not risk offending them.

02:49.480 --> 02:53.040
Prince Bai of Nanzhao is conspiring
with the general of Yizhou.

02:53.120 --> 02:55.680
If Prince Bai cannot be detained,
we must arrest Niu Jin first.

02:56.800 --> 02:57.640
Also,

02:58.920 --> 03:00.640
make sure to mention in your document

03:01.320 --> 03:03.360
that this Shu red wedding attire
belongs to Yingying.

03:03.440 --> 03:05.800
She is kind enough to let them see it.

03:06.400 --> 03:09.080
Take good care of it
and return it as soon as possible.

03:12.200 --> 03:13.200
Alright.

03:14.720 --> 03:15.840
Should we continue with our investigation?

03:15.920 --> 03:16.880
Of course.

03:17.400 --> 03:19.160
We need all the evidence we can get.

03:20.200 --> 03:21.640
Besides the ones we already know about,

03:22.680 --> 03:24.400
check the ones
transporting other goods as well.

03:25.080 --> 03:26.720
Those merchants are full of tricks.

03:26.800 --> 03:27.720
They have a habit of evading taxes.

03:28.840 --> 03:30.240
Just because they claim
they will not head to Nanzhao

03:30.320 --> 03:32.080
does not mean they will not go there.

03:32.160 --> 03:34.800
But so many foreign merchants
are passing through Yizhou.

03:34.880 --> 03:37.120
It will be impossible
to check them all in time.

03:37.760 --> 03:39.320
We do not need to investigate
every single one.

03:39.920 --> 03:40.800
Then, how should we go about it?

03:43.520 --> 03:46.200
- Have some tea.
- What tea?

03:46.280 --> 03:47.680
I still have plenty of work to do.

03:58.680 --> 04:02.040
Let me ask you this.
How much is Shu brocade worth?

04:04.360 --> 04:06.760
The brocade is as valuable as gold.

04:07.640 --> 04:08.880
Next question.

04:09.400 --> 04:12.080
Who should wear such fine brocade?

04:12.720 --> 04:15.120
High-ranking officials
and distinguished nobles.

04:17.480 --> 04:20.839
But if ordinary folks
were able to enjoy such luxury,

04:21.560 --> 04:26.040
they would surely sing praises
about the Yang family's generosity.

04:26.120 --> 04:28.440
This would also help
the Yang family build good ties.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.720
What use are the praises

04:30.800 --> 04:33.640
of lowly folks?

04:33.720 --> 04:35.680
Let me teach you something.

04:35.760 --> 04:38.440
If the poor were to wear brocade,

04:38.520 --> 04:41.880
it would spoil the nobles' refined taste.

04:42.640 --> 04:44.520
It is just brocade fragment.

04:44.600 --> 04:46.800
Are those nobles really that petty?

04:46.880 --> 04:47.720
What insolence!

04:48.480 --> 04:50.040
How dare you disrespect your elder!

04:50.120 --> 04:53.240
Is this how you speak to your uncle?

04:53.320 --> 04:56.440
Mrs. Yang, the new bride
does not know any better.

04:56.520 --> 04:57.680
No matter how busy you are,

04:57.760 --> 05:00.640
you should still find time
to discipline her.

05:01.640 --> 05:04.200
Thankfully, Sir Yang showed up just before

05:04.280 --> 05:06.160
anything could go wrong.

05:11.040 --> 05:14.840
I was the one who permitted Yingying
to use the brocade fragment.

05:14.920 --> 05:17.360
If Yingying is truly at fault,

05:17.440 --> 05:21.360
then, as the matriarch,
I should take responsibility too.

05:22.600 --> 05:24.360
- Madam…
- Yingying,

05:24.440 --> 05:25.800
please hold your tongue.

05:25.880 --> 05:29.320
You have always
been meticulous in managing

05:30.160 --> 05:31.720
the Yang family business.

05:32.480 --> 05:36.160
Someone must have manipulated you

05:36.880 --> 05:38.520
and clouded your judgment.

05:38.600 --> 05:42.520
We trust you will handle this fairly

05:42.600 --> 05:45.360
to preserve the Yang family's dignity.

05:48.760 --> 05:49.960
I had a lapse in judgment.

05:52.600 --> 05:55.800
Luckily, Sir Yang intervened
before anything could go wrong.

05:58.120 --> 05:59.440
That said,

06:00.720 --> 06:02.560
we must not make a big deal of this.

06:02.640 --> 06:04.480
If this blows up,

06:04.560 --> 06:07.920
it could tarnish the Yang family's name.

06:08.880 --> 06:09.800
What do you all think?

06:09.880 --> 06:10.960
Well…

06:11.040 --> 06:13.000
You are the one in charge.

06:13.080 --> 06:14.520
Just handle it as you see fit.

06:19.160 --> 06:20.000
Yingying,

06:20.800 --> 06:22.680
stop the brocade fragment business.

06:22.760 --> 06:24.400
Since you are new to the family

06:24.480 --> 06:25.400
and unfamiliar
with the Yang family's rules,

06:25.480 --> 06:28.240
it almost led to a major incident.

06:28.320 --> 06:30.600
Copy the Yang family's rules three times.

06:39.920 --> 06:40.920
Sure.

06:45.480 --> 06:46.840
Three times.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.640
Make sure you do not miss a single word!

07:11.240 --> 07:12.520
I promised you,

07:14.160 --> 07:15.680
but I ended up stopping you.

07:19.160 --> 07:20.400
I broke my word.

07:23.040 --> 07:24.040
I am sorry.

07:27.920 --> 07:29.560
We cannot fight with the clan.

07:31.200 --> 07:34.720
We may come out on top today,
but tomorrow is another story.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.760
I am married into the Yang family.

07:39.000 --> 07:41.040
Despite being in charge,

07:41.560 --> 07:43.800
I must abide by the Yang family's rules.

07:45.400 --> 07:47.360
Can't these rules be changed?

07:48.360 --> 07:50.320
The Yang family's rules
have been passed down

07:51.520 --> 07:53.120
for generations

07:54.320 --> 07:56.160
and are deeply ingrained in the family.

07:58.080 --> 07:59.920
They are not so easy to change.

08:12.000 --> 08:16.240
YUEBUHUAN INN

08:19.480 --> 08:21.560
I used to think
that the wives of wealthy families

08:21.640 --> 08:23.200
just spent their days counting money.

08:24.160 --> 08:26.840
But it seems like
every family has its own troubles.

08:32.440 --> 08:33.520
You guessed wrong.

08:37.400 --> 08:40.440
Those elders are all
so difficult to deal with.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.400
If you do it wrong, they criticize you.

08:42.480 --> 08:44.640
But if you do it right,
they accuse you of breaking the rules.

08:47.240 --> 08:49.440
My mother warned me
not to cause any trouble,

08:49.520 --> 08:51.520
but trouble came looking for me instead.

08:53.120 --> 08:53.960
What would you do?

08:55.440 --> 08:57.280
Leave, or just put up with it.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.520
Is there no other choice?

09:00.200 --> 09:01.560
If there were,

09:02.080 --> 09:03.680
I would not have left the Yang family.

09:06.880 --> 09:08.480
Well, I'm choosing the third option.

09:08.560 --> 09:09.800
What is it?

09:10.320 --> 09:11.640
I have not figured it out yet.

09:15.160 --> 09:17.800
Maybe it will be
all for naught in the end.

09:21.160 --> 09:22.760
I will continue
the brocade fragment business.

09:22.840 --> 09:25.920
I do not care who is in charge.
I just want to prove them wrong.

09:27.640 --> 09:29.760
I think it is a good idea.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.040
If the Yang family refuses to sell it,

09:31.120 --> 09:33.240
Bloom Society
can make and sell it ourselves.

09:34.160 --> 09:36.240
I also think it is a great idea.

09:36.920 --> 09:41.120
Would Ms. Ji be interested
in selling it at Fan City?

09:41.720 --> 09:42.960
Mr. Bai, you came uninvited.

09:43.040 --> 09:44.840
This seems a little improper.

09:47.040 --> 09:49.840
Apologies. That was rude of me.

09:53.000 --> 09:55.480
But I have been meaning to meet Ms. Ji

09:55.560 --> 09:57.560
for quite a while.

10:03.040 --> 10:07.360
I heard
your brocade fragment business ended,

10:07.440 --> 10:09.120
and it is such a pity.

10:09.640 --> 10:10.760
So, I came here today

10:10.840 --> 10:13.640
to discuss
a potential collaboration with you.

10:15.280 --> 10:17.640
The profit made from the brocade fragment

10:17.720 --> 10:20.120
is hardly anything for someone like you.

10:22.720 --> 10:23.560
So, you see,

10:24.520 --> 10:27.400
business is just a front
to build a friendship with you.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.680
It could work.

10:36.600 --> 10:39.440
But if we are collaborating,
I will be the one setting the terms.

10:43.880 --> 10:45.480
As you wish, Ms. Ji.

11:19.840 --> 11:20.680
Come this way!

11:24.920 --> 11:26.880
Shu brocade sachets,
Shu brocade gift boxes,

11:26.960 --> 11:29.120
- and Shu brocade products!
- Come, take a look!

11:29.200 --> 11:31.440
Sharing joy with the people
through Shu brocade products!

11:31.520 --> 11:32.640
Shu brocade pouches, Shu brocade sachets,

11:32.720 --> 11:33.960
- Shu brocade gift boxes!
- This is good.

11:34.040 --> 11:35.920
- Come and have a look, everyone!
- Don't miss it!

11:36.760 --> 11:38.640
- Come and have a look.
- Miss, this is really amazing!

11:38.720 --> 11:39.920
- It's made from us.
- This…

11:40.000 --> 11:42.000
- It's made from us.
- Shu brocade sachets and gift box.

11:42.080 --> 11:42.920
- Come and have a look.
- Feel free to take a look.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.280
It is amazing.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.240
How about

11:46.720 --> 11:47.560
this brocade gift box?

11:51.840 --> 11:53.760
Where did you get these brocades from?

11:53.840 --> 11:55.840
Who permitted you all to sell these here?

11:57.920 --> 12:00.480
Sir, Shu brocade is as valuable as gold.

12:01.080 --> 12:03.400
Even the brocade fragments and sample
pieces are too precious to waste.

12:03.480 --> 12:04.840
So, we have decided to make
small trinkets from them.

12:04.920 --> 12:06.080
Yeah.

12:06.160 --> 12:09.240
These are just the brocade fragments
from your clothing.

12:09.320 --> 12:12.640
We use them to make little trinkets
that everyone can afford.

12:12.720 --> 12:14.800
This is the spirit
of sharing joy with the people.

12:18.200 --> 12:19.560
Goods come in all qualities and prices,

12:20.400 --> 12:22.800
just as people are separated into classes.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.440
They are not worthy to use

12:25.920 --> 12:27.000
what I use!

12:27.080 --> 12:28.560
Why not?

12:29.480 --> 12:31.200
BAICAO SHOP

12:31.280 --> 12:33.160
Shu brocade is made by the people.

12:33.240 --> 12:34.520
Why are they not worthy of it?

12:34.600 --> 12:36.000
- Yeah!
- Exactly.

12:37.040 --> 12:38.640
Regardless of how successful
your business gets,

12:38.720 --> 12:40.760
you still hire ordinary folks

12:41.280 --> 12:43.680
and sell your goods to them.

12:44.520 --> 12:47.200
By granting them these small favors,

12:47.280 --> 12:50.720
they will gladly work for you
and buy more of your goods.

12:50.800 --> 12:51.640
Is that not a good thing?

12:52.320 --> 12:55.240
Mr. Sang, I do not mind these things,

12:55.760 --> 12:58.920
but the other officials
will never buy your words.

13:00.000 --> 13:02.680
He is wrong. You are wrong. Why so?

13:02.760 --> 13:04.880
Because those officials
are much more particular.

13:05.600 --> 13:07.560
There was once a minister
in the previous dynasty

13:07.640 --> 13:10.520
who wore patched clothes to court.

13:10.600 --> 13:14.080
He was later praised by the wise ones.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.840
Shu brocade is not just beautiful,

13:16.920 --> 13:19.800
but it can also earn a reputation
for sharing joy with the people.

13:19.880 --> 13:20.880
Is that not a good thing?

13:20.960 --> 13:22.400
- Yeah! Is that not a good thing?
- Is that not a good thing?

13:25.720 --> 13:27.000
Let me tell you one more thing.

13:28.320 --> 13:31.040
- What was it again?
- May the legacy of virtue

13:31.120 --> 13:31.960
FROM TANG DYNASTY POET CUI HAO'S
CLEAR WATER AS A MIRROR

13:32.040 --> 13:33.080
Resonate through the ages

13:33.160 --> 13:34.840
May the legacy of virtue

13:34.920 --> 13:36.440
Resonate through the ages!

13:39.040 --> 13:42.240
Mr. Sang, your words
have truly enlightened me.

13:42.320 --> 13:45.400
Well… In that case,
I will grab a few of these myself.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.400
- Yeah! Go on!
- It is all about

13:46.480 --> 13:47.640
- sharing joy with the people.
- Okay.

13:47.720 --> 13:49.280
Everyone is welcome here!

13:49.360 --> 13:52.000
You have changed so much
in just three days.

13:52.080 --> 13:53.200
This way.

13:53.280 --> 13:54.360
This is nothing.

13:54.440 --> 13:55.760
It is all thanks to Ms. Ji,

13:57.080 --> 13:58.360
the former president,
for showing me the way.

13:58.440 --> 14:00.000
Shu brocade trinkets!

14:00.080 --> 14:02.280
GOOD GOVERNANCE AND SOCIAL HARMONY

14:02.360 --> 14:03.200
Shu brocade pouches!

14:03.280 --> 14:04.960
Everyone, come take a look!

14:06.400 --> 14:07.640
What a pity.

14:09.200 --> 14:10.280
Why do you say so?

14:11.480 --> 14:12.840
If this had happened earlier,

14:12.920 --> 14:15.960
you would have been the one
calling the shots there.

14:16.480 --> 14:17.960
But now,

14:18.040 --> 14:19.560
after you have married
into the Yang family,

14:19.640 --> 14:20.880
you no longer have that freedom.

14:24.720 --> 14:25.720
Mr. Bai,

14:26.520 --> 14:27.760
I heard that men from Nanzhao

14:27.840 --> 14:30.880
usually inherit the last word
of their father's name as their surname.

14:31.400 --> 14:32.360
What is your father's name?

14:33.560 --> 14:36.880
Ms. Ji, why are you suddenly
so interested in me?

14:38.520 --> 14:40.840
You know everything about me,

14:40.920 --> 14:44.000
but I know very little about you.

14:44.080 --> 14:46.360
You will never fail only if you know
your enemy as well as yourself.

14:46.440 --> 14:48.560
I need to know your weaknesses

14:48.640 --> 14:50.240
before I can continue
working with you without worrying.

14:50.320 --> 14:51.280
Weakness?

14:53.000 --> 14:53.840
Very well.

14:54.480 --> 14:58.000
My weakness
is that I do not eat sweet food.

15:00.240 --> 15:02.240
- You are not sincere at all.
- Fine.

15:02.320 --> 15:03.480
I was just joking.

15:03.560 --> 15:04.560
No need to take it seriously.

15:04.640 --> 15:07.200
But you do not seem the type to jest.

15:08.880 --> 15:11.400
Alright. What do you want to ask about?

15:11.480 --> 15:14.520
I will tell you anything
and everything that I know.

15:14.600 --> 15:15.720
Truly?

15:15.800 --> 15:16.760
Yes.

15:20.480 --> 15:23.240
Why don't you tell me about Nanzhao?

15:25.440 --> 15:28.000
I thought you wanted
to get to know me better.

15:28.080 --> 15:30.200
Why are you asking about Nanzhao again?

15:30.960 --> 15:33.000
People are shaped by their roots.

15:33.080 --> 15:35.080
It is only natural for me
to start with your background.

15:35.680 --> 15:37.480
Is that so?

15:37.560 --> 15:41.320
Alright. What would you like to know
about Nanzhao?

15:42.600 --> 15:43.920
For example…

15:44.440 --> 15:46.240
Nanzhao's brocade business.

15:47.600 --> 15:50.760
What about the Nanzhao merchants
that come to Yizhou?

15:51.360 --> 15:53.160
Does Nanzhao have their own brocade?

15:55.960 --> 15:59.280
The answer to these questions
will be very long.

16:00.120 --> 16:01.720
It is fine. Take your time.

16:02.840 --> 16:06.800
But the problem is…
I am very hungry right now.

16:07.560 --> 16:08.440
How about this?

16:08.520 --> 16:10.160
Buy me a meal.

16:10.240 --> 16:12.480
We will talk as we eat. How about that?

16:15.240 --> 16:17.560
Shopkeeper! Get us a bowl of lamb noodles!

16:17.640 --> 16:18.680
Coming!

16:19.840 --> 16:21.320
One bowl of lamb noodles?

16:21.400 --> 16:22.880
- Is it not sufficient?
- It is.

16:28.760 --> 16:29.720
Please enjoy.

16:29.800 --> 16:30.840
Alright, thank you.

16:34.680 --> 16:35.840
This is your wages.

16:36.360 --> 16:37.680
You can only have it after you answer me.

16:39.400 --> 16:40.240
Very well.

16:41.280 --> 16:44.200
Nanzhao's silk is not the same
as Zhongyuan's.

16:44.280 --> 16:45.440
It cannot be made into brocade.

16:45.520 --> 16:46.880
That is why all these years,

16:46.960 --> 16:49.320
Nanzhao has been purchasing
brocade from Yizhou.

16:51.080 --> 16:53.160
Merchants usually depart from Yizhou.

16:53.240 --> 16:56.080
They travel by the Shu-Yuandu route.

16:57.760 --> 16:58.880
You must stay calm.

16:59.680 --> 17:02.400
With Ms. Ji's character, she would never…

17:03.480 --> 17:04.760
My wife

17:05.280 --> 17:06.960
has the freedom
to work with anyone she likes.

17:07.040 --> 17:08.319
But who is that with her?

17:08.400 --> 17:09.680
That is Prince Bai!

17:10.800 --> 17:11.640
I am depending on you.

17:13.800 --> 17:14.800
Must we do this?

17:23.119 --> 17:26.960
Mr. Yang's newly acquired prized steed
was accidentally lost in Fan City!

17:27.040 --> 17:30.760
All merchants are requested to cooperate

17:30.840 --> 17:33.080
and await Mr. Yang's investigation!

17:37.280 --> 17:38.400
You lost your horse?

17:38.480 --> 17:41.520
Yes! A good horse was lost just like that!

17:44.440 --> 17:45.520
Mr. Bai

17:45.600 --> 17:47.520
will not mind if I have a look
at your residence, will you?

17:51.880 --> 17:54.760
Do you suspect that I stole your horse?

17:56.560 --> 17:58.160
I ate from that just now.

17:58.680 --> 17:59.760
So sweet!

17:59.840 --> 18:00.760
No!

18:01.280 --> 18:02.920
I do not suspect you.

18:03.000 --> 18:06.200
I suspect all of you here.

18:10.560 --> 18:11.400
Chi Hu,

18:12.240 --> 18:14.520
take Mr. Yang
to the stables to have a look.

18:14.600 --> 18:15.680
Yes.

18:16.960 --> 18:18.800
Mr. Bai, is there something wrong
with your ears?

18:18.880 --> 18:20.480
I said everyone!

18:21.240 --> 18:22.440
Why?

18:22.520 --> 18:24.000
You want to chase me away
with your servant?

18:25.520 --> 18:27.560
Please do not misunderstand.
That is not my intention.

18:27.640 --> 18:31.240
But I have something
to discuss with Ms. Ji.

18:31.320 --> 18:32.720
I am not able to leave now.

18:34.040 --> 18:35.840
Yingying, you can come with us.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.800
Husband and wife should be united.

18:38.880 --> 18:41.480
What is there that I cannot hear?

18:41.560 --> 18:42.560
Yang Jinglan.

18:43.920 --> 18:45.920
Even if you are officially married,

18:46.000 --> 18:49.160
you are not able to listen in
on everything about her business.

18:52.840 --> 18:54.240
Mr. Bai, give us a moment.

18:54.320 --> 18:55.160
Come with me.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.440
Please wait a moment.

18:59.080 --> 18:59.960
Yingying.

19:00.040 --> 19:02.000
Must you force him into a corner?

19:02.080 --> 19:04.760
Did you not head to Chang'an already?

19:06.240 --> 19:07.440
There is not enough evidence.

19:08.720 --> 19:09.560
I am doing this now

19:09.640 --> 19:11.240
to make him think
that I am suspicious of him

19:11.320 --> 19:12.640
and getting close to him.

19:12.720 --> 19:14.320
So he will not dare to simply make a move.

19:14.400 --> 19:16.240
We need to buy time for Chang'an.

19:17.480 --> 19:18.760
What are you doing here?

19:21.120 --> 19:22.400
Business!

19:23.800 --> 19:25.960
Do not worry.
I am only focused on the business.

19:26.040 --> 19:27.440
I am not taking risks.

19:30.080 --> 19:32.240
Fine! Since you are here, I will leave.

19:32.880 --> 19:35.160
Alright! You can go ahead.

19:35.240 --> 19:36.920
Put your hand down. Raise your voice!

19:37.720 --> 19:39.400
Why are you not going home
since I have come?

19:39.920 --> 19:42.080
Why are you raising your voice?
I will go right now!

19:42.160 --> 19:43.480
Go to hell!

19:45.280 --> 19:46.520
Ms. Ji?

19:46.600 --> 19:47.480
Ms. Ji!

19:49.920 --> 19:51.240
Mr. Bai,

19:51.320 --> 19:53.520
my wife was rude to leave without a word.

19:53.600 --> 19:55.840
I apologize to you on her behalf.

19:55.920 --> 19:57.200
You are taking this too seriously.

19:57.280 --> 19:59.560
Ms. Ji has always been like this.
It is fine.

20:02.560 --> 20:03.600
What is it?

20:03.680 --> 20:05.120
- Stable.
- Stable!

20:05.960 --> 20:07.160
Here. This way, please.

20:17.120 --> 20:20.240
Look at this! Horses
from Nanzhao are different.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.400
Why do you say that?

20:22.480 --> 20:23.760
Tubo is arid.

20:23.840 --> 20:26.040
Nanzhao is humid.
Zhongyuan is in the middle.

20:26.120 --> 20:28.080
Horses that have been in different regions

20:28.600 --> 20:30.080
have a different shine to their coat.

20:34.720 --> 20:37.600
Do you think horses
will get used to their current climate

20:37.680 --> 20:40.040
after being there for a long time,
just like humans?

20:40.880 --> 20:43.040
We will find out after we have tested it.

20:43.120 --> 20:45.080
Mr. Bai, please lend me your pouch.

20:57.040 --> 21:00.680
This proves that it hasn't forgotten
Nanzhao's scent.

21:03.560 --> 21:07.120
Is the horse you are looking for
inside this stable?

21:07.200 --> 21:08.680
It is not here at all.

21:08.760 --> 21:11.560
After all, I bought
a good and loyal horse.

21:13.360 --> 21:15.040
Zhuge! Let's go.

21:23.480 --> 21:26.320
Tell our men not to make
any moves lightly.

21:26.840 --> 21:29.160
Cooperate with him
however he investigates.

21:29.680 --> 21:31.480
At this point, the more moves we make,

21:31.560 --> 21:33.240
the easier it will be to make a mistake.

21:33.760 --> 21:36.480
Also, send some men
to keep watch on Niu Jin.

21:36.560 --> 21:38.760
He is not the type to sit back
and wait for things to happen.

21:38.840 --> 21:41.400
We are not the only ones in this mess.

21:42.720 --> 21:43.600
Yes.

21:44.640 --> 21:49.040
So, are we going to disrupt
Ji Yingying's business in Fan City or…

21:49.120 --> 21:52.080
We are not going to do that.
We are going to help her instead.

21:52.160 --> 21:53.720
The more successful her business is,

21:53.800 --> 21:56.800
the bigger the conflict
she has with the Yang family.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.640
Liu?

22:05.600 --> 22:07.720
Ms. Ji, you are back.

22:07.800 --> 22:09.240
You are…

22:09.320 --> 22:10.160
I am old.

22:10.840 --> 22:11.800
I am not able to work anymore.

22:12.760 --> 22:13.800
I am leaving the Yang family.

22:13.880 --> 22:15.320
I was planning to leave without a word.

22:15.400 --> 22:17.040
But you helped me before.

22:17.640 --> 22:19.880
I must bid farewell to you properly.

22:20.800 --> 22:24.120
I wish you and Mr. Yang
safety and success.

22:24.800 --> 22:26.000
Why are you leaving suddenly?

22:29.400 --> 22:30.800
Did my issues cause you trouble?

22:30.880 --> 22:33.760
Ms. Ji, please stop asking.

22:35.040 --> 22:36.000
If you do not tell me the truth,

22:36.080 --> 22:37.960
- I will speak to the matriarch right now.
- Do not do that.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.040
Sir Yang said that

22:40.560 --> 22:42.840
I got you into
the brocade fragment business.

22:42.920 --> 22:45.120
He says that I harbor bad intentions.

22:45.200 --> 22:46.240
He sent me away.

22:47.280 --> 22:51.120
However, the matriarch felt bad for me
and gave me a large sum of wages.

22:51.200 --> 22:53.720
It will be enough to support
my family for a long time.

22:53.800 --> 22:55.600
Preposterous!

23:00.760 --> 23:04.400
How dare you slack off
while serving Sir Yang!

23:04.480 --> 23:07.440
How dare you slack off
while serving Sir Yang.

23:07.520 --> 23:12.200
How dare you slack off
while serving Sir Yang!

23:13.160 --> 23:14.280
Stop.

23:24.800 --> 23:25.640
Get up.

23:29.400 --> 23:30.840
Ms. Ji…

23:35.560 --> 23:36.800
Uncle Yang,

23:36.880 --> 23:38.880
what did Jin Xiu do to make you hit her?

23:40.000 --> 23:41.400
I came to your quarters.

23:42.480 --> 23:43.720
She slacked off while serving me!

23:44.600 --> 23:45.480
She deserves to be beaten.

23:46.160 --> 23:48.800
I might believe you
if you said it was someone else,

23:48.880 --> 23:52.520
but Jin Xiu is the most rule-abiding maid
in the Yang residence.

23:53.040 --> 23:55.680
Not just you, even if a dog came in,

23:55.760 --> 23:57.840
she would attend to it
according to our rules.

23:59.520 --> 24:00.800
Ji Yingying, have you lost your mind?

24:01.640 --> 24:02.800
Are you insulting me?

24:02.880 --> 24:04.600
How did I insult you?

24:08.840 --> 24:10.600
Come at me if you are upset.

24:11.200 --> 24:13.640
Even if my people really made a mistake,

24:13.720 --> 24:15.200
there is no need for you to be involved.

24:17.200 --> 24:18.040
Fine.

24:19.560 --> 24:23.640
I will tell you clearly
that I am here for you!

24:24.320 --> 24:27.160
I beat her to punish you.

24:27.240 --> 24:29.080
It is your fault for selling
those brocade fragments.

24:29.960 --> 24:31.640
I want to tell everyone

24:31.720 --> 24:33.880
that I am beating her to punish you!

24:33.960 --> 24:35.120
- Continue!
- Try it and see!

24:38.840 --> 24:41.120
The brocade fragments
are being sold by Bloom Society

24:41.200 --> 24:42.600
in Fan City.

24:42.680 --> 24:46.320
It has nothing to do with me
or the Yang family at all.

24:46.840 --> 24:48.880
Even if you brought
the whole clan here again,

24:48.960 --> 24:50.600
I did not do anything wrong.

24:51.320 --> 24:53.600
Nothing at all?

24:56.000 --> 24:57.280
Let me ask you.

24:57.360 --> 25:01.480
Do you admit
that you are working in public

25:01.560 --> 25:04.760
and are suspected
of being intimate with other men

25:04.840 --> 25:06.160
despite being a daughter-in-law
of the Yang family?

25:06.240 --> 25:09.240
Which businesswoman does not have
to be out in public when doing business?

25:09.320 --> 25:12.040
Do you dare to bring this up
in front of the matriarch?

25:13.640 --> 25:15.000
Being intimate with other men…

25:15.080 --> 25:17.280
There were so many people
in the city today.

25:17.360 --> 25:18.400
Jinglan was there too.

25:18.480 --> 25:20.280
I did not cross the line at all.

25:20.800 --> 25:23.800
Please do not judge people
with your dirty thoughts.

25:23.880 --> 25:25.040
Me?

25:26.240 --> 25:28.120
You are so useless!

25:28.200 --> 25:29.720
I am going to beat her today.

25:29.800 --> 25:31.560
Let me see who dares to stop me!

25:32.400 --> 25:34.320
The Yang family's Rule 23 states

25:34.840 --> 25:37.280
that servants should follow the lead
of their masters with proper decorum.

25:37.360 --> 25:38.800
Rule 65 states

25:38.880 --> 25:39.760
that there is a distinction
between internal and external affairs.

25:39.840 --> 25:42.200
Internal matters should be prioritized
and external ones are not to affect them.

25:42.280 --> 25:43.680
What nonsense are you talking about?

25:43.760 --> 25:44.720
What is the meaning of this?

25:45.360 --> 25:47.080
Thanks to you,

25:47.160 --> 25:50.320
I copied the Yang family's rules
three times.

25:50.840 --> 25:52.400
I am very familiar with it.

25:53.600 --> 25:55.200
These two rules mean that

25:55.280 --> 25:56.960
I am going back to my mother's home.

25:57.040 --> 26:00.400
As my personal maid,
Jin Xiu must go with me.

26:01.000 --> 26:02.440
As for this punishment,

26:02.520 --> 26:05.360
we will talk about it again
when I get back.

26:08.760 --> 26:11.920
Jin Xiu, pack our bags. We are leaving.

26:13.640 --> 26:14.800
Yes.

26:19.200 --> 26:20.240
Why are you still here?

26:21.800 --> 26:23.960
Did I remember any of the rules wrongly?

26:24.040 --> 26:25.480
Or are you staying to send me off?

26:26.360 --> 26:28.640
I am leaving!

26:29.400 --> 26:30.480
You are going to your mother's home?

26:30.560 --> 26:32.480
Wonderful!

26:32.560 --> 26:36.320
Never come back again if you can.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.520
Let's go!

26:38.120 --> 26:39.040
Wait.

26:41.080 --> 26:43.080
Leave the punishment stick behind.

26:48.400 --> 26:49.520
Let's go!

27:01.480 --> 27:04.560
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

27:09.960 --> 27:11.400
Mother's cooking is still the best!

27:11.480 --> 27:13.760
Eat slowly. Nobody will fight with you.

27:14.640 --> 27:15.640
Here.

27:17.120 --> 27:19.240
Ms. Ji, your manners!

27:24.600 --> 27:26.480
You can leave us. Get some rest.

27:26.560 --> 27:27.920
There are not so many rules here.

27:29.040 --> 27:31.800
Ms. Ji, according
to the Yang family's rules,

27:31.880 --> 27:33.360
when you are outside, I have to…

27:33.440 --> 27:35.600
I have to complain
to my brother and mother!

27:35.680 --> 27:37.240
It is not convenient with you around.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.520
Hurry up and get some rest!

27:42.240 --> 27:44.040
My orders are also
the Yang family's rules.

27:45.000 --> 27:46.000
Yes.

27:51.480 --> 27:53.640
Yingying, this girl…

27:53.720 --> 27:55.520
Mrs. Yang saved her life once.

27:55.600 --> 27:56.920
She wants to repay Mrs. Yang,

27:57.000 --> 27:59.000
so the Yang family's rules
have completely brainwashed her.

28:00.160 --> 28:02.080
You said that you have complaints.

28:02.160 --> 28:03.360
Is Yang Jinglan not treating you well?

28:04.040 --> 28:06.680
No. It is not Yang Jinglan
who is not treating me well.

28:06.760 --> 28:07.720
It is the Yang family.

28:07.800 --> 28:08.680
The Yang family?

28:10.600 --> 28:12.280
It is not exactly the Yang family.

28:12.360 --> 28:14.480
It is… It is my opinion

28:14.560 --> 28:17.120
that are in conflict with
the Yang family's rules.

28:19.360 --> 28:21.920
Are you on the right side,
or are the rules on the right?

28:23.960 --> 28:27.560
Those rules maintain the operation
of the whole Yang family clan.

28:27.640 --> 28:29.040
It is not completely useless.

28:29.720 --> 28:31.000
But it is too rigid.

28:31.680 --> 28:33.000
Some are not compassionate at all.

28:33.080 --> 28:35.120
Some only benefit the clansmen

28:35.200 --> 28:36.880
while holding back the advancement
of the whole Yang family.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.680
You have it broken down so well.

28:40.200 --> 28:41.680
You must have made up
your mind, have you not?

28:44.000 --> 28:45.120
Just do what you want.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.640
I trust you.

28:48.120 --> 28:50.560
Those who follow me will succeed.
Those who reject me will perish.

28:53.960 --> 28:55.080
Gui!

28:57.400 --> 28:59.160
- Mr. Yang.
- Jinglan is here?

28:59.240 --> 29:01.080
- Come on!
- Mother.

29:02.240 --> 29:03.600
Ji Gui, get a set of utensils!

29:06.720 --> 29:07.960
I am here just in time.

29:08.040 --> 29:11.160
Would you all like to try my cooking?

29:13.240 --> 29:15.360
- Quickly! Have a seat.
- Here.

29:17.200 --> 29:18.200
Why did you come?

29:18.280 --> 29:21.120
I came back for a visit
because I missed my mother and brother.

29:21.640 --> 29:23.960
I missed my family too.
That is why I came back to visit.

29:25.600 --> 29:27.160
There are so many dishes!

29:27.240 --> 29:28.280
Especially this one!

29:28.360 --> 29:29.440
I know it will taste good
from the looks of it!

29:30.480 --> 29:33.360
Mother means to say
that you should come more often.

29:33.960 --> 29:34.920
Come whenever you want, alright?

29:35.000 --> 29:36.600
Yes! Understood!

29:41.800 --> 29:43.440
- Eat some! Try this.
- Here!

29:45.600 --> 29:48.600
- Mother,
- I am really not that fragile.

29:48.680 --> 29:50.520
I have made up my mind
about how to deal with them

29:50.600 --> 29:52.440
on my way home.

29:52.520 --> 29:53.440
I will not admit defeat.

29:54.760 --> 29:57.120
You are very strong. That is your ability.

29:57.640 --> 30:00.200
I want to protect you.
These are my feelings.

30:01.240 --> 30:04.840
Are you willing to accept my feelings?

30:10.960 --> 30:12.280
I would like to hear.

30:12.360 --> 30:13.760
I would like to hear it too.

30:15.080 --> 30:15.920
Tell me.

30:16.680 --> 30:17.880
Alright.

30:17.960 --> 30:19.880
I have sent men to check
the accounts of the Yang family's store.

30:20.520 --> 30:21.360
The reason?

30:21.440 --> 30:23.920
My second uncle says
that everyone in the Yang family

30:24.000 --> 30:26.160
follows the rules, except my wife.
They can pass any investigation.

30:26.840 --> 30:27.960
Since they can,

30:28.040 --> 30:30.160
then we will investigate them thoroughly

30:30.240 --> 30:31.800
to see if they follow the rules.

30:33.600 --> 30:35.360
Crush one's spirit to destroy their soul.

30:36.400 --> 30:37.280
Here!

30:37.360 --> 30:39.480
Let us drink to crush their spirits!

30:40.080 --> 30:41.120
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

30:44.080 --> 30:46.800
Let us drink to not take alcohol
for three months

30:47.560 --> 30:49.520
- for a long and healthy life.
- Cheers.

30:55.200 --> 30:56.880
I will follow your advice.

31:43.880 --> 31:44.720
Ji Yaoting!

31:47.560 --> 31:48.400
Show yourself.

31:50.200 --> 31:51.120
Show yourself!

31:52.240 --> 31:53.880
I am leaving if you do not show yourself.

31:53.960 --> 31:55.080
No!

32:01.600 --> 32:02.800
You made this swing?

32:03.520 --> 32:06.200
Yes. I submerged these wood in herbs.

32:06.280 --> 32:08.400
The book says that this can prevent
mosquitoes and bugs from coming close.

32:10.080 --> 32:11.520
Why are you holding that?

32:13.480 --> 32:15.760
I planted some peach trees over there.

32:15.840 --> 32:18.160
It will bloom this time next year.

32:25.480 --> 32:28.040
Do you know why I come here
on this day every month?

32:30.440 --> 32:33.640
The eighth is the date
when merchants return home.

32:34.360 --> 32:37.480
From this spot, you can see
the route your father takes.

32:39.000 --> 32:41.680
You and your mother
always waited for him here.

32:42.200 --> 32:43.800
Later on,

32:45.600 --> 32:48.680
you came here alone to think of them.

32:50.320 --> 32:51.800
The bell on the swing

32:52.400 --> 32:54.200
was given to me by your father's friend.

32:54.280 --> 32:55.640
It was the horse bell that they used.

32:57.760 --> 33:01.600
I wanted to let you feel more comfortable

33:01.680 --> 33:03.720
whenever you remember them here.

33:05.120 --> 33:07.160
When you think of this place again,

33:07.240 --> 33:10.080
you will have more good memories.

33:18.920 --> 33:21.600
Did I… make a mistake somewhere?

33:22.720 --> 33:24.080
You did very well.

33:26.240 --> 33:27.520
I am very touched.

33:31.760 --> 33:34.000
But I am not a debutant
who has not experienced life.

33:36.280 --> 33:37.760
When one is deeply in love,

33:37.840 --> 33:40.240
who would not be willing to go all out
and be understanding?

33:40.760 --> 33:41.720
But as the days go by…

33:41.800 --> 33:44.080
Nobody can predict
how the future would look like.

33:47.920 --> 33:50.480
That is why I do not want to make
any other promises to you.

33:51.000 --> 33:52.920
I will prove myself to you by my actions.

33:55.960 --> 33:57.480
Why are you so stubborn?

33:59.880 --> 34:01.800
If I can find
the start of the silk thread,

34:01.880 --> 34:04.520
I can fix them up tidily.

34:05.680 --> 34:08.800
But there are times
you cannot find the start of the thread.

34:09.400 --> 34:11.960
It is crisscrossed over and over.

34:12.040 --> 34:13.800
It can never be fixed again.

34:41.920 --> 34:43.880
Cut it off if you cannot find its start.

34:44.800 --> 34:46.000
Ji Yaoting,

34:46.520 --> 34:48.280
do not get any closer to me.

35:04.040 --> 35:05.840
This can prevent mosquitoes
from disturbing you.

35:17.640 --> 35:19.000
I shall take my leave now.

36:23.240 --> 36:24.480
Next rule.

36:25.120 --> 36:28.640
Brocade weaving begins at Mao hour
and ends at You hour.

36:28.720 --> 36:30.280
You will be paid monthly.

36:30.360 --> 36:33.320
A day's wages will be deducted
if you miss a day of work.

36:33.400 --> 36:34.680
If you miss ten days of work,

36:34.760 --> 36:36.480
then your wages for the month
will be deducted.

36:36.560 --> 36:37.800
That is not fair.

36:38.600 --> 36:40.280
Who would start working at Mao hour?

36:40.360 --> 36:43.520
That seems to be a little inhumane!

36:43.600 --> 36:45.360
Nobody starts working at Mao hour!

36:45.440 --> 36:47.520
Who prepared the porridge
you eat at Chen hour?

36:48.160 --> 36:51.720
Who swept the clean roads
you walk past at Wu hour?

36:51.800 --> 36:53.600
Those are servants. Craftsmen--

36:53.680 --> 36:54.680
Are also workers.

36:54.760 --> 36:57.000
They also have to make money to survive.

36:57.080 --> 36:58.360
That is still unreasonable!

36:58.440 --> 37:01.000
Why should a month of wages be deducted
if you missed ten days of work?

37:01.880 --> 37:03.440
Brocade weaving is different
from other occupations.

37:03.520 --> 37:05.520
You can still make up for it
if you miss a day of work.

37:05.600 --> 37:07.600
But if you miss ten days of work,
someone else needs to be covered for you,

37:08.200 --> 37:10.000
or the whole brocade workshop's
deadline will be delayed.

37:10.080 --> 37:12.240
A large sum of penalty needs to be paid
to the customer who places the order.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.280
The wages for the person
who covers for those who miss work

37:13.360 --> 37:15.960
are usually taken
from the one who causes the situation.

37:17.600 --> 37:18.880
Then…

37:20.000 --> 37:20.960
Then that is reasonable.

37:22.600 --> 37:23.440
Yingying,

37:23.520 --> 37:25.560
I told you that I couldn't do this,
but you made me come!

37:25.640 --> 37:27.000
- I should just leave.
- Sit properly.

37:31.880 --> 37:33.600
Today's objective is to ask all of you

37:33.680 --> 37:35.800
to give opinions
based on your own perspective.

37:36.520 --> 37:37.840
There are old and young people here.

37:37.920 --> 37:39.600
We have brocade weavers
and dyehouse workers here.

37:39.680 --> 37:42.120
We have insiders and outsiders here.

37:42.200 --> 37:44.360
This way, we will be able
to have a more holistic discussion

37:44.440 --> 37:46.040
about the advantages
and disadvantages of the rules.

37:46.720 --> 37:48.720
You are not that wrong.

37:49.240 --> 37:52.040
Deducting a month of wages
for missing ten days of work

37:52.120 --> 37:53.920
does not seem that reasonable.

37:54.000 --> 37:55.640
The brocade industry
has its own characteristics,

37:56.560 --> 37:59.360
but a brocade weaver
is only working to make money.

38:00.480 --> 38:03.200
If it is not unavoidable,
they will not be willing to miss work.

38:04.400 --> 38:07.280
If they are forced to miss work
due to illness or injury

38:07.880 --> 38:09.600
and have a month of wages deducted,

38:09.680 --> 38:11.440
would that not be pushing them lower
in their time of need?

38:11.520 --> 38:12.920
That is right! That is what I meant.

38:13.000 --> 38:15.080
Ms. Zhu, you are indeed my soulmate!

38:19.320 --> 38:22.320
Well… I meant to say that
Ms. Zhu is correct.

38:22.400 --> 38:24.680
This does seem a little unreasonable.

38:25.360 --> 38:27.960
Do you all still think there is
anything else that is unreasonable?

38:28.680 --> 38:29.520
It is all unreasonable.

38:29.600 --> 38:31.880
The people pushing their horse faster
would not care how the horse thinks.

38:32.800 --> 38:34.120
What does that have to do with horses?

38:34.200 --> 38:35.600
Who is buying horses?

38:40.400 --> 38:41.320
Mr. Yu.

38:43.960 --> 38:45.120
Please sit.

38:47.120 --> 38:48.680
Nobody is buying horses.

38:51.040 --> 38:52.800
We are discussing the rules
in the brocade industry.

38:53.680 --> 38:55.720
This is because some rules
were set since long ago,

38:55.800 --> 38:57.200
so it is no longer relevant
in today's society.

38:57.280 --> 39:00.080
Some seem to have secured
existing benefits,

39:00.160 --> 39:01.320
but it has actually
hindered long-term growth.

39:02.480 --> 39:05.000
That is why I have gathered
everyone here to talk about it today,

39:05.080 --> 39:06.800
to see if there are
any unreasonable points.

39:09.000 --> 39:10.280
Xi was rambling again.

39:11.040 --> 39:12.800
What does it have to do with horses?

39:13.760 --> 39:14.800
No.

39:14.880 --> 39:15.920
Xi meant to say

39:16.000 --> 39:18.800
that the rules are written
by the employers.

39:18.880 --> 39:20.520
It is expected that it guards
the benefits of the employers.

39:20.600 --> 39:23.200
None of the rules
would protect the employees.

39:23.800 --> 39:25.600
Instead of questioning
if the rules make sense,

39:26.200 --> 39:28.240
we should ask ourselves
which side we are on.

39:28.880 --> 39:30.440
Which side do you want to be on?

39:31.720 --> 39:34.640
I am an employer,
but I am also an employee.

39:35.640 --> 39:37.680
It does not matter which side I am on.

39:38.200 --> 39:39.280
I am on the side of justice.

39:40.960 --> 39:43.120
I do not want the weavers who work hard

39:43.200 --> 39:44.720
to not be able to afford
a few pieces of Shu brocade

39:46.200 --> 39:49.600
or be sent away
without a proper reason, like Liu.

39:50.120 --> 39:53.760
Or be too afraid to go to a doctor
when they fall sick.

39:55.040 --> 39:55.880
Philanthropist!

39:57.240 --> 39:59.000
Of course, I want to make money too.

40:01.040 --> 40:02.440
Being good to my employees
does not conflict

40:02.520 --> 40:03.680
with making money.

40:04.200 --> 40:06.360
If they have a better quality of life,
they would be more motivated.

40:06.440 --> 40:09.840
Then the products of their work
would be worth even more.

40:09.920 --> 40:10.920
How about this?

40:11.440 --> 40:13.160
Let us add one more rule.

40:13.680 --> 40:15.200
Those who do well will be paid more.

40:16.080 --> 40:17.320
This would indeed achieve
a win-win situation.

40:18.960 --> 40:20.920
When we have set up the rules properly,

40:21.000 --> 40:23.240
we can experiment with them
on our family's new brocade workshop.

40:24.200 --> 40:26.280
Some of the rules can also
be used in Bloom Society.

40:26.360 --> 40:27.920
Dyeing and weaving are not that different.

40:28.000 --> 40:29.040
I agree!

40:30.480 --> 40:32.120
I am old now.

40:33.560 --> 40:37.560
These apprentices
are the future of the Yu family.

40:37.640 --> 40:39.680
Have you heard everything just now?

40:39.760 --> 40:42.480
Do you have any thoughts? Voice them out.

40:44.120 --> 40:45.200
Say something!

40:45.280 --> 40:46.440
What is wrong?

40:47.160 --> 40:49.440
Have all of my apprentices become mute?

40:52.400 --> 40:53.320
Master,

40:54.200 --> 40:56.280
I think that men will all die.

40:56.880 --> 40:58.640
Yu Huai'en, you will lose
all your hair if you copy me!

40:59.480 --> 41:00.640
W-Why would he lose his hair?

41:00.720 --> 41:01.640
I will pull it off.

41:02.600 --> 41:03.640
S-So that is why!

41:04.760 --> 41:06.920
I meant to say
that men will all die one day.

41:07.000 --> 41:08.920
Why are rules not allowed to die?

41:09.000 --> 41:10.680
Mountains will return to the sea.

41:10.760 --> 41:12.440
Clouds will turn into rain.

41:12.520 --> 41:15.680
Natural events will happen naturally
and evolve naturally.

41:17.400 --> 41:18.640
Good!

41:19.160 --> 41:20.640
You are very perceptive!

41:23.560 --> 41:25.040
I suppose my family

41:26.240 --> 41:28.360
will also have to go
with the flow of nature.

41:30.520 --> 41:34.720
SAN HUA PAVILION

41:41.480 --> 41:44.560
Jin Xiu told me
you have always preferred plain food.

41:45.160 --> 41:47.600
I ordered a few dishes
according to your preference.

41:48.920 --> 41:50.040
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

41:51.640 --> 41:54.000
How has your mother been lately?

41:54.520 --> 41:55.960
Is she feeling better?

41:56.840 --> 41:58.320
Thank you for your concern.

41:58.400 --> 41:59.680
Mother is very well.

42:02.440 --> 42:04.080
Since you went home,

42:04.600 --> 42:07.200
spend more time there and accompany her.

42:09.000 --> 42:10.080
Actually,

42:10.160 --> 42:11.480
the reason I did not return
to the Yang residence

42:11.560 --> 42:12.760
is not to take care of my mother,

42:14.000 --> 42:14.840
but…

42:14.920 --> 42:17.920
I do not have the confidence
to return to the Yang residence yet.

42:23.400 --> 42:24.320
Leave us.

42:25.560 --> 42:26.480
Yes.

42:33.200 --> 42:34.400
Is it because

42:35.080 --> 42:38.480
you are still upset
about the sample pieces?

42:38.560 --> 42:39.640
Yes,

42:41.200 --> 42:42.480
and no.

42:43.640 --> 42:45.760
After the incident with the sample pieces,

42:45.840 --> 42:47.360
I understood a few things.

42:48.120 --> 42:49.440
The main branch of the Yang family

42:49.520 --> 42:52.920
and its extended family
are closely connected in their businesses.

42:53.000 --> 42:56.000
That is why you are able to face outsiders
when dealing with business.

42:56.080 --> 42:57.880
It has made the Yang family
strong and impenetrable.

42:57.960 --> 42:59.920
This is also one of the main reasons

43:00.000 --> 43:01.280
the Yang family is able to be
so successful for over a century.
